---
// Time-dependent join: each purchase is matched to the rate that was valid at purchase time. Rates and amounts are illustrative.
// Plain inline SVG with site CSS tokens; polygon arrowheads avoid duplicate marker ids.
import DiagramIcon from './DiagramIcon.astro';
---
<figure class="unb-fig">
  <div class="unb-scroll">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 900 316" role="img" aria-label="Timeline of three exchange-rate periods with two purchases. The 10:30 purchase uses the 1.08 rate and the 13:15 purchase uses 1.10. Replaying with today's rate would give a wrong amount.">
      <text x="20" y="26" class="unb-h"><tspan data-lang-en>Matching each purchase to the rate valid at that time</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghép mỗi đơn mua với tỷ giá có hiệu lực lúc đó</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="52" text-anchor="start" class="unb-lane-sub"><tspan data-lang-en>Rate change stream</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Luồng đổi tỷ giá</tspan></text>
      <rect x="40" y="62" width="270" height="48" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={65} y={86} size={26} />
      <text x="199" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>€1 = $1.08</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>€1 = $1.08</tspan></text>
      <text x="199" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>valid 09:00 to 12:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hiệu lực 09:00 đến 12:00</tspan></text>
      <rect x="310" y="62" width="270" height="48" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={335} y={86} size={26} />
      <text x="469" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>€1 = $1.10</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>€1 = $1.10</tspan></text>
      <text x="469" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>valid 12:00 to 15:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hiệu lực 12:00 đến 15:00</tspan></text>
      <rect x="580" y="62" width="270" height="48" rx="4" class="unb-box" />
      <DiagramIcon name="money" x={605} y={86} size={26} />
      <text x="739" y="82" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>€1 = $1.07</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>€1 = $1.07</tspan></text>
      <text x="739" y="99" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>valid 15:00 to 18:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>hiệu lực 15:00 đến 18:00</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-tick"><tspan data-lang-en>09:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>09:00</tspan></text>
      <text x="310" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-tick"><tspan data-lang-en>12:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>12:00</tspan></text>
      <text x="580" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-tick"><tspan data-lang-en>15:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>15:00</tspan></text>
      <text x="850" y="128" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-tick"><tspan data-lang-en>18:00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>18:00</tspan></text>
      <path d="M175,176 L175,119" class="unb-solid is-good" /><polygon points="170.5,120 179.5,120 175,112" class="unb-head is-good" />
      <path d="M422,176 L422,119" class="unb-solid is-good" /><polygon points="417.5,120 426.5,120 422,112" class="unb-head is-good" />
      <rect x="60" y="176" width="250" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="receipt" x={85} y={204} size={26} />
      <text x="209" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Purchase at 10:30: €50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua lúc 10:30: €50</tspan></text>
      <text x="209" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>rate 1.08 → $54.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tỷ giá 1.08 → $54.00</tspan></text>
      <rect x="330" y="176" width="250" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box is-good" />
      <DiagramIcon name="receipt" x={355} y={204} size={26} />
      <text x="479" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Purchase at 13:15: €50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Mua lúc 13:15: €50</tspan></text>
      <text x="479" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>rate 1.10 → $55.00</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>tỷ giá 1.10 → $55.00</tspan></text>
      <rect x="600" y="176" width="250" height="56" rx="4" class="unb-box is-hot is-dash" />
      <DiagramIcon name="warning" x={625} y={204} size={26} />
      <text x="749" y="200" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-b"><tspan data-lang-en>Today's rate: $53.50</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Dùng tỷ giá nay: $53.50</tspan></text>
      <text x="749" y="217" text-anchor="middle" class="unb-in-m"><tspan data-lang-en>wrong for the 10:30 order</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>sai cho đơn lúc 10:30</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="262" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-good"><tspan data-lang-en>On replay, each purchase is joined with the rate valid at its own time, so the results match the first run.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Khi chạy lại, mỗi đơn được ghép với tỷ giá có hiệu lực lúc đó, nên kết quả khớp lần chạy đầu.</tspan></text>
      <text x="40" y="286" text-anchor="start" class="unb-note is-hot"><tspan data-lang-en>Joining old orders with the latest rate silently changes last month's numbers.</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>Ghép đơn cũ với tỷ giá mới nhất sẽ âm thầm làm đổi số liệu tháng trước.</tspan></text>
    </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>The rate stream keeps history, so a replay can look up the rate that applied at purchase time.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Luồng tỷ giá giữ lại lịch sử, nên khi chạy lại ta tra được tỷ giá áp dụng lúc mua.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .unb-fig { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .unb-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .unb-fig svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .unb-fig text { font-size: 14px; fill: var(--text-body); }
  .unb-fig .unb-h { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-h { font-size: 14.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig .unb-lane-sub { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-b { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 13.5px; }
  .unb-fig .unb-in-m { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note { font-size: 13px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-hot { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-note.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); font-weight: 700; }
  .unb-fig .unb-mono { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, monospace; }
  .unb-fig .unb-tick { font-size: 12.5px; fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-panel { fill: none; stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-fill { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1; }
  .unb-panel.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-panel.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-box.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.6; }
  .unb-box.is-dash { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-good { fill: none; }
  .unb-box.is-dash.is-hot { fill: none; }
  .unb-solid { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-solid.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 2; }
  .unb-solid.is-dashedline { stroke-dasharray: 5 4; stroke-width: 1.2; }
  .unb-dashed { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 5 4; }
  .unb-dashed.is-hot { stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-dashed.is-good { stroke: var(--gold-icon); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .unb-head { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .unb-head.is-hot { fill: var(--red); }
  .unb-head.is-good { fill: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-step { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .unb-step.is-hot { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); }
  .unb-step.is-good { fill: var(--gold-tint-bg); stroke: var(--gold-icon); }
  .unb-fig .unb-step-n { font-size: 12.5px; font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); }
  .unb-fig figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
